@Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5025
@ApiKey = dev-only-api-key

### Pi motion ingestion (multipart burst upload)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="frame.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./frame.jpg
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="isOfflineSync"

false
------boundary--

### Analyze a file that already exists on the captures volume (JSON)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events/analyze
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imagePath": "/data/captures/test.jpg",
  "capturedAt": null,
  "isOfflineSync": false
}

### Analyze an uploaded frame (multipart)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/events/analyze
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="frame.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./frame.jpg
------boundary--

### Admin login (initial password = physical device code / Admin__DeviceCode)
POST {{Security_Camera_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "CAM-0000-DEV1"
}
